{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d5ee7553645398b805f13e0c2b88121ea6844e21964f4325495d8d7289aa80ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8db756bfb6e9d85c965c09aeea94e0102a3b6f50029451b298883d62ba6ab9",
      "text": "Mega华丽☆生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:343b3f88364a39fa93d18d460038850525b35520728f6d6c4ee42325fe305b1e",
      "text": "被春名问到生日想要什么礼物的四季，\n回答说想要办一场Mega华丽的派对。\n对这方面了解甚少的春名、隼人、旬、夏来等人，\n为了办出四季喜欢的Mega华丽而大费脑筋……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000031:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000031:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8db756bfb6e9d85c965c09aeea94e0102a3b6f50029451b298883d62ba6ab9",
      "text": "Mega华丽☆生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf3bb77d31e9eb18e7681dadbe8ff59f8a24d77cb9ff6670479d0bd88f641cd",
      "text": "呐四季，马上就是你的生日了，\n你有什么想要的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74757decb45bf7859231d419d4ba7c9712ee192012f7de6d38f358707c09259",
      "text": "这个嘛～……啊，前几天\n我发现了一件感觉不错的夹克……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd829d8a3c093b82c64a72bb09f8add978e6fbad58099059d0912fb209084d0e",
      "text": "等等，我这边就没有惊喜了吗！？\n我也想要惊喜啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3ddc56a2ed98736b3c6baa749d5db1d0ed2483c26a008022451fe38735c5c78",
      "text": "已经连续搞过好几次了，\n根本就没办法算作惊喜了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a3a14ab888b2a5756419b783754db59448430a50d3f67dcc381e017e6d3d9c",
      "text": "确、确实……好像也是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4597454ff894270c28f69ff2c9d6bb618cbc0f74c9411972ae5ce27d6523cf0",
      "text": "相对的……这次，会塞满四季喜欢的东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:749d28401f3f0800bf9dac01db6d2e83930f31e70291f23c79a0eb60f1b34160",
      "text": "想要的东西，或者想让我们做的事，\n尽管说出来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869b0a08e941269952af3a55324b6f89806752eaaf5fd5e3b76328fd1b5b40b2",
      "text": "既然这样的话……\n我想要Mega华丽的派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85c96441deacfa0cf9d31c9b93c6426ef8ce6a8352b0a3bc55a5270d340d62ae",
      "text": "……Mega华丽是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d177a7105c708bebfe70b65a217383b5822b50514f7e95f76ae58d6700d91576",
      "text": "Mega华丽就是Mega华丽啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1035b9f735798a35fc1437e4573dea2ce2c25570f7ec43c90c5c2fe5818f94",
      "text": "就是超级闪亮亮、\n能让情绪嗨翻天的那种！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de2f0e67443201d64f3175529b4b5b9da3464c7842d3165ffd73138c74565094",
      "text": "那个……总之我们会努力试试的。\n敬请期待生日派对吧，四季！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2dd92a9379bfcbf035bf1132f0b437c93d5bde6ff305989bdab4560fff4d4c6",
      "text": "话虽说是要搞得Mega华丽……\n但我们对那种东西根本一窍不通啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea8408a883419e48ef2c3ea36c9965acb8320bf0f2cfa72a2548577e11ef6c9",
      "text": "是啊。虽然隼人昨天\n发来了各种各样的图片……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5510f586a28d80d836bfd6064576809dec4b05769c5e3866289b4c28cef6a0e8",
      "text": "但想把那些还原出来也很难吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9085ed456bf4336d63a30bb2fee6b101dac42980837dcfd2b97dc8415f247a6e",
      "text": "霓虹灯招牌……还有满是彩灯闪闪发光的店……\n看起来，好耀眼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e43d684bd8c003f6193c6cf4d54cf6fd4edf1607a2057ebf72f0687cdc25c7",
      "text": "啊哈哈……那么大规模的\n果然还是做不来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:678e1f7ac9309e41e99d3dd957b31f546f4e56b662d5a6d801bd2c58727d0bf1",
      "text": "圣诞节装饰程度的话感觉还能想想办法，\n但要说华不华丽总觉得不太对劲……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5faedadc5beece92730c93c6f30df8ae6daff280dbf07f4b4d043e5314988e17",
      "text": "喂，这个怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9348bda9f323635c0fdcbe43d6ab3767701c041472d341e9ee90a25463ea7b75",
      "text": "……镜面球？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c52a71ab0d623426930afbe2b9170d57d03063fa10c87b32fee62216fedf6c92",
      "text": "没那么贵，而且放地上的那种既简单，\n又纯粹很华丽吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9ef5e552134b99b21ac20e2ff72ed77244e56d0049dbe5f41802390d7bbf2bc",
      "text": "嗯，感觉挺不错的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f76ab9fc391c5f35a96af79abcaa314edc182edd00cc3bd53dc06e66245541",
      "text": "那就这么定了。\n那么，蛋糕该怎么办呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f31bbcab87e4ceba0e3eca2d941aaac1435878feb11d636349638036456dcd",
      "text": "想必蛋糕也还是做得华丽一些\n会比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f19da565d97754986433e17565823e4638d1f5368e8e814245e25cb2e7676c0",
      "text": "……四季之前说过很在意这种……\n图片，我这里有哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a3deb3c8002a9fd51a014c8c3220573727f8bf8dab6baff6c189da61452d65",
      "text": "哇啊……好色彩斑斓的蛋糕！\n我还是第一次见到这种。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a035b5bab77704a1ab7f05f5ba942ec8fdae188a648b4a0ce5724218196c3b",
      "text": "很有四季风格的蛋糕啊。\n这绝对能让他高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c02fecf72fd73076ad11751b75e31a433f81e62840361a0a81af8b2fdfd3b665",
      "text": "……不过，看起来是一家非常热门的店呢。\n好像每天都在排长队。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a664e17ddf0ab75de9020631b5485ead74eebad6f6bfc2c71abee942667f2370",
      "text": "真的假的？也就是说，不动作快点的话\n说不定就会卖光的那种？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b888972e7841158efedfb11bd1464aafae46aa339a95705977728289dfdd4428",
      "text": "好像……不能预订……\n只能……去排队了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cde4ec60559d9b7f0393472d1c8e0ea8c33b1d9f24534b9add28e91f3accef7",
      "text": "可是四季君的生日是在工作日，\n我们身为学生恐怕去排不了队啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0a75db2a47e9a0e6484291d0a3e124a7977ea80ec592b5571d81183b627b2ad",
      "text": "嗯……好，死马当活马医，\n去跟●●●●プロデューサー商量看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_c:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6d186a28624774d9c7b648335e074ea8b785c8ecf69e75e7079e7227bf7ebd",
      "text": "为了四季的生日，一定愿意\n施以援手的。我这就去联络！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0182b9ed6b2608325cde10aae6bf90e647c740250e5176e84a7966621ded7ec6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n辛～苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45b0a8adf5c5e75571a3f58f405c521c4905109c1daf76b98d8ef4c5a1f61cb9",
      "text": "锵——！\n想让你看这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb88840829c5ebf65baf88adbdfda09430680c183511e32a07eb699fe8fd2d33",
      "text": "卡片……？色彩缤纷真漂亮呢。\n贴纸的装饰也很可爱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaf230914c72ee4feb44ea2e5310ead415cd450cb30b92572b163fb660164731",
      "text": "对吧～？这是我生日派对的邀请函！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8820da5bebb782d75e148fa71afe54d4be002f713ab619bfc88c31a4b7dbde04",
      "text": "是春名亲给我的哦。果然\n有邀请函就是会让人情绪高涨呢～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa365908f9290d094e4defac7965ad3d26aecda0f7c057378391c1246e0b8e45",
      "text": "我已经Mega MAX迫不及待地等着过生日了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:785633d3a0680c155e41e6c89c18aad933efb3f43d8522ed759b892d33a56a7b",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天的碰头会也请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e3ffff6da6be75fb13b15571faee0ba9848ac59cba5bea0de7b89af0992c281",
      "text": "啊！隼人亲！\n快看看这个～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bdadb5c064eef7286d986a7db3fab1673fcdea20b1693bcce21a425f24b8d83",
      "text": "（……四季先生看起来\n非常期待生日派对呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7594be811ce6aa6bb3511a7d1293e1084955d5e6ad13b752969301c67a7969e6",
      "text": "（这下当天一定要想办法搞到蛋糕才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000032:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44b4445d14869ea1a17c81c5c074dbce28bc5122f7e132ef177b54e69e7b50c4",
      "text": "四季……从这里开始闭上眼睛。\n……我牵着你，走过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:514a7b70d4d27334946af9faac64444ad2ddc23e0bda8739e5688358bb79650c",
      "text": "好、我知道啦！\n感觉好紧张啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d039f8cc0a5038de8d8ce02e1679d10487f7bf4fdaf36d51b85044ce26e641fc",
      "text": "那么……走咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b65052d07b951d1893ca84abc1d0797eeadf66c296e08f21d0a8526367a4c11",
      "text": "……到了哦。可以睁开，眼睛了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1523d9b65af23dcf3c61f59aa8cbde208e1336b3b74e92da5551abcf45e2b5b0",
      "text": "哇，好刺眼……！\n等等，这个……是镜面球吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ecdb1b4f20ce169cfb1110330aa8b0f77b6942ceff6c0df5915511f4e6b4975",
      "text": "怎么样？够Mega华丽吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe0fe9197512b486fd602a9fe1805464ab8bcd3ea08b29073355b20990151a8b",
      "text": "……！……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495f651585183f330fcc6f7e8803ad8290cb798a8b1905670603a20ce73957c6",
      "text": "喂，没事吧？四季。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a71edb86a839c8f43d8006a2407a916d91dd2f1f9c4aba0140da0ea4c738b437",
      "text": "太……太——帅太绝啦！\n好厉害！真超级Mega厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1446c6b9974c6fdb36fb745fe9fec5e8d9fda5c9cab18cc4a5ce3d77c1bb4322",
      "text": "看来你很喜欢呢。\n今天还准备了另一件华丽的东西哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dccd6db3b68f46bd51e1a363f140fa38877abe5d7a2eedaa000a03be8d9bafe8",
      "text": "啊！这个蛋糕，\n不是那款超火根本买不到的蛋糕吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1cedb2d0490bb44cdb911a3dc8f8df2c4b90c3c25372244de3823a924d800c",
      "text": "是●●●●プロデューサー去排队买回来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d69387ffc4621e9a1f52bc59eef63afd8008ec3fc4102cc4c4f8a92e1f70f1",
      "text": "真的假的！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d3ff7994459cf1a53f167524bdc34e3b77fb9430d445a0fee22b1ce04049b8",
      "text": "居然为了我做到这种地步……\nMega感动……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b893bbc8eeb8b09a815dc6fd4991386c7a811b6964b4c95f452e8eca58644d4a",
      "text": "大家……谢谢你们！\n今天成了最棒的Mega华丽生日啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000202:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ca8b44d44b1df589cfadf4ffa73e94b0d063a04031b0bf3de5d3707a4e36807",
      "text": "太好了……四季，很高兴呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afffca1bbc6a77006d92f1b35a82a176658f1db9858299a74796aade61e0800d",
      "text": "那么，今天就痛痛快快地\n享受派对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_02_1_2_024_02:1_2_024_02_e:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec9dc101d7656544132cbd7c957f5acfa3019db41a9534ce0a8001c6a9586cb",
      "text": "生日快乐，四季！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
